{"id":209,"flavor":[{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"In contrast to its appearance, it’s quite timid. When playing with other puppy Pokémon, it sometimes gets bullied."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It grows close to others easily and is also easily spoiled. The disparity between its face and its actions makes many young people wild about it."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Its growls make its opponents uneasy. This laid-back Pokémon tends to sleep half the day."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Despite its intimidating face, it’s quite cowardly. Its desperate attempts to appear threatening make it popular with people."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"By baring its fangs and making a scary face, Snubbull sends smaller Pokémon scurrying away in terror. However, this Pokémon seems a little sad at making its foes flee."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Small Pokémon flee from its scary face. It is, however, considered by women to be cute."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"It has an active, playful nature. Many women like to frolic with it because of its affectionate ways."},{"games":["HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"Although it looks frightening, it is actually kind and affectionate. It is very popular among women."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"By baring its fangs and making a scary face, it sends smaller POKéMON scurrying in terror. The SNUBBULL does seem a little sad at making its foes flee."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"In truth, it is a cowardly POKéMON. It growls eagerly in order to hide its fear from its opponent."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Intimidate","hidden":false,"description":"When the Pokémon enters a battle, it intimidates opposing Pokémon and makes them cower, lowering their Attack stats."},{"name":"Run Away","hidden":false,"description":"Enables a sure getaway from wild Pokémon."},{"name":"Rattled","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon gets 